I call the salon again.
The receptionist picks up the phone.
"Hello, Panampilly Nagar Salon," she says.
"Hello, I am Maya," I say.
"I have an appointment on Wednesday evening at half past five."
"But, I cannot come on Wednesday."
"Can I come on another day?" I ask.
"Certainly, which day are you coming?" she asks.
I always go to the gym on Tuesdays and Thursdays.
Therefore, I do not have time on those days.
"Can I come on Friday?" I ask.
"Okay, at what time are you coming on Friday?" she asks.
"Can I come at a quarter past six in the evening?" I ask.
She looks at the computer.
"A quarter past six... okay, you can come," she says.
"See you on Friday evening at a quarter past six."
"Thank you very much," I say.
I hang up the phone happily.
